  "output": {
    "section_id": "ch01.s04",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "ch01.s04.p01",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p01.r01",
            "text": "Why do large language models matter so much now, and why are they attracting so much attention across applications and careers?",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p01.r02",
            "text": "A simple contrast shows how far natural language processing has come.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p01.r03",
            "text": "One early chatbot from 50 to 60 years ago was \"Elisa\", one of the first chatbots humans developed, and its conversation quickly proceeds nowhere.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@224",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@227",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@230",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@232",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@235",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@298",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@300",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@303",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@305"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p01.r04",
            "text": "By contrast, \"chat GPT\" can answer a request about learning large language models with a response that is extremely useful, to the point, and filled with resources such as books, online courses, and research papers.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@309",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@314",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@321",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@328",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@331",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@334",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@336",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@340",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@343",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@346"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p01.r05",
            "text": "We are living at a stage where LLMs such as GPT are very powerful and very sophisticated.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@349",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@354",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@356",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@360",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@363",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@367"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p01.r06",
            "text": "Generative AI is broader than language alone and includes video, audio, and 3D models.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@500",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@503",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@506"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p01.r07",
            "text": "Some videos can look incredibly realistic even though they are made entirely by artificial intelligence rather than shot on a camera.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@511",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@514",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@519",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@522",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@524",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@527",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@530"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch01.s04.p02",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p02.r01",
            "text": "The same shift appears in interactive text generation.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p02.r02",
            "text": "A prompt such as \"plan a relaxing day\" can ask for a day focused on rejuvenation and request that the system first ask about favorite forms of relaxation.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@277",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@279",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@280",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@284",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@286",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@289"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p02.r03",
            "text": "\"chat GPT\" replies conversationally, asking whether the user prefers spending time outdoors, reading, yoga, or creative pursuits.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@290",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@294",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@297",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@299",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@301",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@303",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@306",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@308"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p02.r04",
            "text": "If the answer is \"reading a book,\" it generates a reading-focused plan with items such as morning meditation, breakfast, reading time, and a nature walk.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@313",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@315",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@318",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@320",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@323",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@325",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@326",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@329",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@331",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@334"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p02.r05",
            "text": "This kind of demonstration shows that large language models understand, generate, and respond to human-like text, and that they also respond like humans.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@247",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@250",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@340",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@342",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@345",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@348"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p02.r06",
            "text": "They are sounding more and more like humans.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@384",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@386",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@389"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch01.s04.p03",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p03.01",
            "text": "These capabilities lead directly to practical applications.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p03.02",
            "text": "The applications of large language models can be divided into five main categories, even though there are several more applications beyond these.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1549",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1552",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1554",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1776",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1778",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1781",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1783",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1785"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p03.03",
            "text": "One category is creating new content that may not already exist.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1556",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1558",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1577",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1580",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1583"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p03.04",
            "text": "For example, a model can write a poem about the solar system in the format of a detective story, and it can also be used to write books and generate media articles.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1560",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1566",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1570",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1573",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1577",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1580",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1587",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1606",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1608",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1611"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p03.05",
            "text": "Another category is chatbot or virtual-assistant use, where a person can interact with the model in an ongoing conversation.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1615",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1618",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1621",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1625",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1627",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1629",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1631",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1632"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p03.06",
            "text": "Chatbots are a huge and major application for airlines, hotel reservation desks, banks, movie and restaurant services, and customer support.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1634",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1638",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1641",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1664",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1666",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1668",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1672",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1673",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1675",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1677",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1679",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1681"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch01.s04.p04",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p04.r01",
            "text": "The remaining categories include machine translation, new text generation, and sentiment analysis.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p04.r02",
            "text": "Machine translation means that text can be translated to any language.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1690",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1693",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1694"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p04.r03",
            "text": "A model can be asked to translate a poem to French, and it can do that immediately.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1696",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1700",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1706",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1708",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1710"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p04.r04",
            "text": "The output can be translated very quickly into many languages, and there is some support for regional languages, with research being done to improve those outputs.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1719",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1722",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1724",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1727",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1728",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1731",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1734",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1737"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p04.r05",
            "text": "Another application is new text generation, including poems, books, media articles, and news articles that did not exist before.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1745",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1747",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1750",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1752",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1755"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p04.r06",
            "text": "Large language models can also be used for sentiment analysis by taking paragraphs and identifying the sentiment, which can be useful for hate speech detection on social media.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1758",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1761",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1763",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1765",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1768",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1771",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1773"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch01.s04.p05",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p05.r01",
            "text": "To illustrate these applications, consider a portal created for school teachers with tools such as a YouTube generator, MCQ generator, text summarizer, text rewriter, worksheet generator, and lesson plan generation.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1787",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1789",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1790",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1792",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1797",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1799",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1802",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1806",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1807"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p05.r02",
            "text": "In one application, selecting the MCQ generator, entering a topic such as \"gravity\", and clicking generate causes the LLM powering the application to produce multiple-choice questions within seconds.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@546",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@548",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@549",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@552",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@555",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@558",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@560",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@562",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@564",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@566"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p05.r03",
            "text": "In another application, a lesson plan on \"gravity\" can be generated and aligned with the CBSE curriculum of India.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1807",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1810",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1811",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1814",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1816",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1819"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p05.r04",
            "text": "The generated lesson plan includes the objective, assessment, key points, opening, introduction to new material, guided practice, and independent practice.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1824",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1826",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1828",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1829",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1831",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1833"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p05.r05",
            "text": "This can save teachers a great deal of time, and it is presented as something that was not possible five years earlier but is possible now with LLMs.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1836",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1839",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1841",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1844"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p05.r06",
            "text": "A similar tool can generate questions on \"World War II\" at hard, medium, and easy levels, along with the correct answers and explanations, and it does so within seconds.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1850",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1852",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1854",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1859",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1862",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1865",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1868",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1872",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1874",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1876",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1877"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ch01.s04.p06",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p06.r01",
            "text": "The broader motivation is not only technical but also practical.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p06.r02",
            "text": "Large language models and generative AI are changing many things around us, including applications provided to teachers.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@566",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@568",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@576",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@578",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@580"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p06.r03",
            "text": "The projected global generative AI job market is expected to grow about five to six times in the next five years.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@585",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@587",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@593",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@595",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@597"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p06.r04",
            "text": "Generative AI and large language models are extremely useful skills, and the need for these skills is only going to increase in the future.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@597",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@600",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@603",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@606"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p06.r05",
            "text": "If you have knowledge about LLMs, the sky is the limit for building wonderful applications.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1892",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1894",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1896",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1898",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1932",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1935",
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1938"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s04.p06.r06",
            "text": "The examples here are only the tip of the iceberg, because LLMs can be used for many more research and industrial applications.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "3dWzNZXA8DY@1940",
